<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 94,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 94,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota  hog receipts Thursday were 94,000 head, compared with the estimate  of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts  firm to .50 higher than mid-session Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    55.00 -56.50	   56.00 -57.50</p>
<p>few			54.50  57.00	   55.50  58.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs.  42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
